<title>MEXICO: Abaco reiterates buy for Autrey.</title>
<headline>Abaco reiterates buy for Autrey.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Abaco financial group has reiterated its buy recommendation for pharmaceutical retail chain Grupo Casa Autrey S.A.</p>
<p>&quot;After two difficult years (1995 and 1996),&quot; wrote analyst Luis Miranda. &quot;Autrey looks poised once again for revenue and earnings growth.&quot;</p>
<p>Miranda estimated Autrey's 1996 and 1997 net profits at 204.3 million and 295.4 million pesos, respectively, or 0.753 and 1.054 pesos per share. He also estimated the share price could appreciate by 71 percent in 1997. Autrey's nominal series shares closed flat at 15.70 pesos on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907</p>
